Z||000000||jeffndebrus||11-23-2001||02:54 PM||||Still trying my options and doing my homework but which engine do you think I should go with?? 4.0 32 valve aurora  or<BR>4.9 caddy???<BR>a)which one would fit better?<BR>b)which one would be easier to make run(ecm)?<BR>c)should I keep my stock auto tranny or swap?<BR>d)which one would you do if you could buy a brand new aurora engine for $400.00??||||reg||1
Z||000001||KissMySSFiero||11-23-2001||03:11 PM||||32 valve aurora engine is the same as the N* just different displacement.  N* has more power and its a 4.6 ltre.   the cadi 4.9 is supposed to be a fairly simple swap.  a few on here have done it as well.  4.9 will be much cheaper and simpler. <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <BR>88FORMULA<BR>       <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>        <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
